    "intro_html":  "There is no clever angle here. This is beef stew, the way it has been made for as long as people have had pots. Chuck roast browned hard, flour and tomato paste to build the body, broth, and then time. It freezes better than almost anything else in this section and it tastes better on day two. Each bowl carries \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and {{cal}} calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
